INTRO = "Stepping onto the night sidewalk outside the noisy restaurant, Ra Joon-mo runs into assistant director Shin Hye-joo, whom he has been casually seeing without real commitment. Stung by Youn Yuh-jung's scolding about honesty, Joon-mo decides to end things clearly and politely instead of vanishing. Listen to the Korean first, then we'll go through it together."
